# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/engine-reuse four-card development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the window's combined branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-engine-reuse-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the combined branch (the W2 + Lever N + prefix route with engine reuse merged
# in); substitute it in every template with one command (sed -i 's/tp4-engine-reuse-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every
# template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# A1 (ER0 and ER1 a, c, f, g): the AUDITED PARKED arm on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-parked-audit, the same tests as A0. READ in this order and stop at the first failure: (1) ER0, the attach: "parked engines built k=8 of 8", the drafter warm
# at P=2048 with a prewarm count above zero, the P7p ledger per card (each parked engine 0.46-0.51 GB per chip, at least 3.6 GB free after the eight: parked_judge.ledger_problems), no stop line, the
# audit's attach check that no build replayed a block's trace; (2) c2_smoke_check clean (its parked rules: widths, programs, fallbacks, digests, instance state); (3) python scripts/ci/parked_compare.py
# --control <A0 smoke log> --parked <A1 smoke log> --control-container <A0 container log> --parked-container <A1 container log> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-parked-audit exits 0: every answer's hash, token count and finish equal,
# every digest line equal, the drafter's accepted-prefix sequences identical. ANY difference is NO-GO. Record the rebind ms, the attach ms and the free DRAM per card. Stop rule.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-engine-reuse-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-parked-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,parked_equal,parked_budgets,levern_equal,levern_equal_busy
